WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Welcome to Foundry UI. This short walkthrough shows how reusable components work together.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Responsive previews, theme controls, and copyable code are available in every example.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Each pattern is portable, accessible, and ready for desktop, tablet, and phone layouts.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.700
Use the library as a starting point, then customise its design tokens for your product.
